	</tbody>
</table>
&nbsp;<br />
二級泳灘包括：
<table border="0" style="width:520px">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="height:23px; width:265px">釣魚灣泳灘＊</td>
			<td style="height:23px; width:299px">黄金泳灘＊</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="height:23px; width:265px">近水灣泳灘＊</td>
			<td style="height:23px; width:299px">海美灣泳灘＊</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="height:23px; width:265px">大浪灣泳灘＊</td>
			<td style="height:23px; width:299px">麗都灣泳灘＊</td>
